bootstrap app.php this is where the actual booting of the project happens, routing files, middleware, exceptions are all configured here before the project starts.

then the request travels and finds the route which is mentioned in the wep.php or the api.php and finds the metioned controller and method where the actual request and response is written.   before the request reaches the controller it can be valided using the http/requests files so the validated data reaches the controller where it gets valided before moving ahead of other insert update operations. also before controller if middleware is setup it checks the request before it reaches the controller.

