the $fillable is used in the model file to define what fields are required to travel through the request the attributes/parameters which are not added in the $fillable are not allowed for futher operations in the controller if they are tried to access.


$guarded is used to hide the importand details fromt he request while keeping it in the request this makes attacking such attributes/parameters difficult for the attacker.

